# Rows appear before each comment, in their own place.
click #more
click #more
# The first `Show` takes its body, the region its other arm, the helper's
# branch its other arm; the text after them is written in place.
click #flip
click #name
click #more
# Every row and the second `Show` go; the regions switch back.
click #less
click #less
click #less
click #flip
